  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "UNACKNOWLEDGED DATA PROBLEMS: The analyst applied an incorrect unit conversion for assay_batch B (dividing by 10). According to the data dictionary, batch B reports in µg/L, which is equivalent to 1 ng/mL (1 µg/L = 1 ng/mL), so no scaling is needed. The reported mean of 40.21 ng/mL is therefore biased low."
  ]
}
